-  2000's: Subaru Impreza WRC 07, Ford Focus WRC, CitroÃ«n C4 WRC;
-  90's: Toyota Celica Turbo 4WD - '92, Mitsubishi Lancer Evo III - '96, Subaru Impreza WRC - '97, Lancia Delta Integrale HF - '91;
-  80's: CitroÃ«n BX4 TC, Ford RS200, Lancia Delta S4, Peugeot 205 T16, Renault 5 GT Turbo;
